    <briefdescription>
<para>Central controller of the game logic. Responsibilities: </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Maintain the current <ref refid="class_cube_state" kindref="compound">CubeState</ref> (logical model).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Coordinate animation and rendering.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Apply moves safely (ensuring animations finish before next move).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Trigger solver and scramble sequences. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
